	('4633a8fd-e174-4af3-a743-64a3a89254cd', 'test-st-shenouda-press-9', 'testing text', 'This powerful and timeless message from Fr Bishoy Kamel cuts through the noise with piercing clarity: Jesus didn’t just show us a way. He is the Way. This book challenges modern believers to stop asking “Am I Christian?” and start asking “Am I on the Way?” With deep Scriptural reflection and pastoral honesty, Fr. Bishoy walks us through the hard sayings of Christ, from turning the other cheek to loving our enemies, and shows us how these teachings, though difficult, are the only path to life, peace, and union with God. Through stories of saints, sinners, and the least expected followers of Jesus. From the thief on the cross to the sinful woman with the alabaster jar, the book reveals how the hardest commandments become a joy when we truly love God. It reminds us that the first step of the Way is admitting our weakness, and the destination is complete oneness with Christ. If you''re tired of easy answers and hungry for the truth of the Gospel, the real, costly, life-giving Way of Christ, this book is your invitation to walk it. These are sermons by Fr Bishoy Kamel first shared in 1959 to the youth of St Mary’s Church in Moharam Bek. Author: Fr Bishoy Kamel ISBN: 978-1-7638415-5-0 Publisher Name: St Shenouda Press Publisher URL: www.stshenoudapress.com Publication Year: 2025 Pages: NA', NULL, 12.00, 'St Shenouda Press', 5, 'https://mckglenrypsuahbsslgf.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/trinity-media/products/f59f5350-04f8-42c2-8ec6-696aca791134.png', false, true, '2026-09-19 13:15:58.857553+00', '2026-09-19 13:15:58.857553+00', '{"St Shenouda Press"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
