	('6473bd95-4496-4249-a721-3d7141b70df2', 'test-st-shenouda-press-6', 'testing text', 'Marriage is more than a commitment—it''s a sacred bond designed by God. In What the Church Fathers Say About Marriage , the wisdom of St. John Chrysostom and other Church Fathers comes alive, offering practical and spiritual insights into building a Christ-cantered marriage. From navigating mutual respect to embracing the deeper purpose of unity, this book explores timeless truths that speak to the heart of every couple. It unpacks the beauty of love, the challenges of parenting, and the joy found in fulfilling God’s design for marriage. This book will inspire you to see marriage not just as a partnership but as a calling. Let the wisdom of the ancients guide you in cultivating a relationship grounded in faith, love, and purpose. ISBN : 978-1-7638415-1-2 Publisher Name : St Shenouda Press Publisher URL : www.stshenoudapress.com Publication Year : 2025 Pages : 90', NULL, 12.00, 'St Shenouda Press', 5, 'https://mckglenrypsuahbsslgf.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/trinity-media/products/c8998a93-7a39-41d4-a24d-560ca00d46fb.png', false, true, '2026-09-19 13:15:15.978819+00', '2026-09-19 13:15:15.978819+00', '{"St Shenouda Press"}', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
